# Cloud packages

- A cleaner is registered with `@register("<cloud>", "<kind>")` and routed in
  `crc/cli/routes/<cloud>.py`; the guide is "Add a cleaner" in `ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- `plan()` only reads; every mutation is in `apply()`, in the order `CLEANUP_SAFETY.md` gives.
- Policy, age and tag decisions come from `crc/core`, not from new code here.
- Inject SDK clients; never build one at import time. Normalise SDK data to `Candidate`.
- Destructive kinds need a real age gate and fail closed on bad age, tags or telemetry.
- Catch specific SDK errors, log the resource id, chain with `raise ... from e`; no silent
  `except Exception`; no retry layer over SDK retries.
- Update the package `README.md` (Public API and Safety Invariants) with the code.
